      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/assets/02dabe7099c201f717885a05842e0cb8543bd01cccf0d6c52147f674cde15dce.png)\n\nLet $U=\\{a,b,c,20,40\\}$ be the universal set and let $R=\\{b,20,40\\}.$ What is the complement of $R?$",
